      "uid": "zhcn:a960d53077d01f61e37e018c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的霸气震撼全场……众人说了，\n“她才是真正伟大的君王”──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e88c18e22041e228dada5e5508f522be97df1b38031da820d2b44058861fb7ec",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
