    {
      "uid": "zhcn:968aba2fd245b420aa54d816",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我奔驰的模样迷倒了上万民众！\n当我前往众多记者等着的记者会现场时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "d492553c5145a355659bad69bffcdef385adde184e257c2cf87997ab9f7e7f58",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48babd69b2d6ba41351938be",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传说说书人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1efca8826ad1a67cebe2eb350d0fe0c2e152dd56ea4736554d1e1bca4b72ef1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:484888315bafd06edadc00f2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "发现记者──竟只有一人！外加怒涛！！\n这真是……不知道我的存在，\n处于绝望深渊之人竟如此之多！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cff185a0b6d5abc4ea241e15bda2036d3d717c9e9378682c598369f3f4c63837",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7de5efe8aed6449fff89c3d7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "传说说书人",
      "source_fingerprint": "c1efca8826ad1a67cebe2eb350d0fe0c2e152dd56ea4736554d1e1bca4b72ef1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1015/storytimeline_501015416.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "name"
      ],
