    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0eabbe29468482ef82854d40",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "于是，我点燃了烽火。\n我发誓将打倒“黄金世代”！\n与劲敌上演一场精彩刺激的激烈交锋！",
      "source_fingerprint": "75452afc7ca9ea720cbbafe4fa7a5614acd2270ba284c7f56b5c332cfe51069c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
