      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“霸王”大获全胜！\n──谢谢你，与我热烈激战的好劲敌！\n──谢谢你们，给予我盛赞的观众们！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f745a8e08590d6b9ca045e5e7d5319420227b71e8fd95fd1e57ed092e35ca72",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
