      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是……我是立志成为“世纪末霸王”之王。\n必须让世代最强的头衔变得屹立不摇──",
      "source_fingerprint": "028fb14bec90deb284d384274f09cb9008ce441908f8728a9ef6bed551f7b071",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
