      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "然后我发现了！败因是……王者的慈悲。\n我太关心其他参赛者了──我痛改前非，\n下次一定要夺得世代最强宝座。",
      "source_fingerprint": "af1f51a687eca894ea31f2a4c9be5764e60650c0b3af9575cd99a87d157aa7e1",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
