      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "而我，对默默地在一旁磨利刀刃，\n来自同世代中新登场的刺客──怒涛说道，\n我将在“宝冢纪念”……接下她袭来的利剑！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fc20e486f24bdd550b0594659ac7500a59bca26de39463d8b579d4afd6451d93",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
